  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Indonesia&#x2019;s Sustainable Digital Health Innovations through Regulatory Sandbox Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to provide technical assistant to the Ministry of Health to implement the regulatory sandbox related to other digital health innovations clusters. The regulatory sandbox is aimed to foster new digital health innovations and is expected to implement in 2024-2025.

The proposed project includes the following activities:
1. Prioritisation of digital health innovation clusters for upcoming regulatory sandboxes
2. Implementation of a continued and sustainable regulatory sandbox Batch 2
3. Supporting the supervision and nurturing process of digital health innovators enrolled in the regulatory sandbox (Batch 1)</narrative>
  </description>
